WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.205
Week 11: Food, Markets, and Restaurants. buy food order a meal handle dietary needs and problems

2
00:00:07.205 --> 00:00:15.348
Form and meaning. Quantities; count and mass nouns; direct objects; polite requests with querer, poder, and quisiera.

3
00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:41.585
Model set. Quisiera probar el plato del día. ¿Cuánto cuesta un kilo de tomates? Para mí, una sopa sin carne. El camarero nos trae la cuenta. Disculpe, pedí agua y no refresco. I would like to try the daily special. How much does a kilogram of tomatoes cost? For me, a soup without meat. The waiter brings us the bill. Excuse me, I ordered water, not soda.

4
00:00:41.585 --> 00:00:51.864
Contrastive practice. Change the person, time, number, or level of formality in each model. Preserve the communicative purpose while the grammar changes.

5
00:00:51.864 --> 00:01:03.978
Production check. Say one original sentence for each function: buy food; order a meal; handle dietary needs and problems. Then write it and compare the spoken and written forms.

6
00:01:03.978 --> 00:01:30.983
Model language. Quisiera probar el plato del día. — I would like to try the daily special. ¿Cuánto cuesta un kilo de tomates? — How much does a kilogram of tomatoes cost? Para mí, una sopa sin carne. — For me, a soup without meat. El camarero nos trae la cuenta. — The waiter brings us the bill. Disculpe, pedí agua y no refresco. — Excuse me, I ordered water, not soda.

7
00:01:30.983 --> 00:01:40.987
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
